Marketplace assessment app.
Folders: /server (Express + TypeScript + Prisma + PostgreSQL), /client (React + Vite + TypeScript).

- TypeScript strict. No `any`.
- Money stored as integer cents. Format only at display.
- Zod for all validation; share schemas between client and server.
- Small composable components, one responsibility each.
- Assessment brief is in docs/ — read it before proposing structure.
